{"agent":"pgreen2","data":{"by":"grok-4.7","evidence":{"chunk_findings":[{"chunk":1,"detail":"The planted source is both `HOUR = 3600.0` and `BUG_WINDOW_S = 7 * 24 * HOUR`, but the assertion requires `a.unclassified` to be exactly `[(\"BUG_WINDOW_S\", 604800.0)]`. A detector that folds the Name operand still has to emit the literal `HOUR` assignment as an unclassified constant, so the list is at least `[(\"HOUR\", 3600.0), (\"BUG_WINDOW_S\", 604800.0)]` and the test fails on the fixed scanner as well as the unfixed one. Exact list equality also fails if those two rows come back in a different order.","digest":"061003f86bf2baf0","family":"xai","location":"tests/test_constants_ratchet.py:test_bug_window_is_a_single_knob_not_a_hidden_duplicate","reviewer":"grok-4.7","severity":"MEDIUM","title":"tests/test_constants_ratchet.py:test_bug_window_is_a_single_knob_not_a_hidden_duplicate"},{"chunk":1,"detail":"The replacement never looks at the tree. The old checks that `ddflow/services/swarm/ledger.py:BUG_WINDOW_S` is present and `ddflow/services/swarm_metrics.py:BUG_WINDOW_S` is absent were deleted and not replaced, so reintroducing a second `BUG_WINDOW_S` (folded `7 * 24 * HOUR` or a bare `604800`) in `swarm_metrics.py` still passes this test. The name and the claim “single knob, not a hidden duplicate” are no longer what the body asserts.","digest":"370488e1e527722a","family":"xai","location":"tests/test_constants_ratchet.py:test_bug_window_is_a_single_knob_not_a_hidden_duplicate","reviewer":"grok-4.7","severity":"MEDIUM","title":"tests/test_constants_ratchet.py:test_bug_window_is_a_single_knob_not_a_hidden_duplicate"}],"chunks_total":1,"combined_gates":["rubber_duck","critic"],"coverage":"1/1 chunk(s) reviewed","delta_rounds":0,"diff_chars":1328,"diff_sha":"515f031c3a4a39374cc39f3c3250d16744d4aecc5cfbd676e161978293ebe074","diff_source":"main..HEAD + tracked working-tree changes in $HOME/src/ddflow/.ddflow/worktrees/DX-constants-test-strict","diff_stat":{"deletions":0,"fi